cjose provides CMake targets:

    find_package(cjose CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE cjose::cjose)

Static-only builds also expose the explicit static target:

    find_package(cjose CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS static)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE cjose::cjose_static)

The umbrella header is <cjose/cjose.h>. The pkg-config module is cjose.
